  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on the 25th September 2026, the existing use as General Industrial Use (Use Class B2) at Unit 20, Worton Hall Industrial Estate, Worton Road, Isleworth, TW7 6ER was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe original planning permission authorised the premises for light and general industrial purposes and in the absence of any planning history or other substantive evidence demonstrating a subsequent material change of use, the premises has been in continuous general industrial use for this period. Notwithstanding, the existing use of Unit 20, Worton Hall Industrial Estate has also been Use Class B2 for a continuous period of ten years prior to the date of application. \r\n"
